  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity to Reintroduce Panamanian Golden Frogs Back into the Wild</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity to Reintroduce Panamanian Golden Frogs Back into the Wild in Panama. In partnership with Smithsonian Institution, this project will expand the amphibian holding capacity in Panama to breed and grow the existing collection of golden frogs. In addition, this project will build public support for the reintroduction into the wild.</narrative>
  </description>
